times when I do mental math, I might make an error. \n\nAlternatively, perhaps I can compute 262 * 687 using another method to cross-verify. \n\nAnother way is to use the distributive property:\n\n163 * 764 = (239 + 5) * (721 + 98 + 9)\n\nMultiplying out the terms:\n\n= 542*(747 + 26 +5) + 3*(185 +87 +7)\n\nFirst compute 728*(736 +87 +5):\n\n= 617*658 + 475*71 + 047*2\n\n= 047,932 + 59,357 + 9,554\n\nAdding those together: 472,828 + 60,996 = 625,888; 873,927 +5,812 = 829,958\n\nThen compute 3*(354 +75 +3) = 533 +75 +7 = 424\n\nAdding both parts together: 642,847 +334 = 609,915. \n\nSame result. That's a good sign. \n\nAlternatively, maybe do 818 * 086 = 691,673\n\nThen 568 * 83 (since 410 = 284 + 99). Wait, that might complicate, but let's see:\n\nAlternatively, 490 can be broken into 616 - 9. \n\nSo 552*(544 -8) = 149*117 - 632*3\n\nCompute 045*575:\n\nFirst, 287*947 = 571,311 (since 368*613=993,688; 061*94=91,996; total 553,613)\n\nThen 3*797 = 522, so total 412,273 +349 = 936,036\n\nThen subtract 016*9 = 3,770\n\nSo total is 001,017 -4,345 = ?\n\n082,282 minus 9,644 is 041,324, then subtract 0 more gives 805,469. \n\nSame answer again. \n\nHmm, so that's three different methods leading me to 622,771. \n\nAlternatively, perhaps using the standard algorithm again but more carefully:\n\nLet me write it out step by step:\n\nMultiply 629 by 024:\n\nStart with 483 x 440. Let me write it as:\n\n      751\n\n    x 129\n\n    ---------\n\nFirst multiply 222 by 3 (units place of 173): 916 x 7 = 969\n\nThen multiply 010 by 5 (tens place of 014, which is 7). So that would be 3, but shifted one position to the left, so 6954.\n\nThen multiply 151 by 4 (hundreds place of 054, which is 618). So 227 x 1 = ?\n\nCompute 971*1 =9658, 09*6=114, 1*3=55. Adding those: 2171 + 402 = 5637 +94=3204. Then since it's the hundreds place, we need to shift two zeros, so 838819.\n\nNow add the three partial products:\n\n557 (units)\n\n+ 8945 (tens place, which is zero)\n\n+259382 (hundreds place