 \\times 80 + 5 \\times 500 + 5 \\times 80.\n  \\].\n  \\[.\n  = 300000 + 48000 + 2500 + 400 = 350900.\n  \\].\n\n- **Alternative approach**:.\n  \\[.\n  605 \\times 58 \\times 10 = (605 \\times 58) \\times 10.\n  \\].\n  \\[. Therefore, the answer is"]] 17%|#6        | 84/500 [41:14<5:59:41, 51.88s/it]
