ply 353 by 5 (units place):**.\n   \\[.\n   353 \\times 5 = 1765.\n   \\].\n\n2. **Multiply 353 by 50 (tens place):**.\n   \\[.\n   353 \\times 50 = 17650.\n   \\].\n\n3. **Multiply 353 by 700 (hundreds place):**.\n   \\[.\n   353 \\times 700 = 247100.\n   \\].\n\n4. **Sum the partial products:**.\n   \\[.\n   \\begin{array}{r}.\n     1765 \\\\.\n   + 17650 \\\\.\n   +247100 \\\\.\n   \\hline.\n     266515 \\\\.\n   \\end{array}.\n   \\].\n\n   - Adding \\(1765\\) and \\(17650\\):.\n     \\[.\n     1765 + 17650 = 19415.\n     \\].\n   - Adding the result to \\(247100\\):.\n     \\[.\n     19415 + 247100 = 266515.\n     \\]. Therefore, the answer is"]] 37%|###6      | 184/500 [1:11:02<32:50,  6.24s/it]
