\n   -------.\n    4566.\n   ```.\n   .\n2. **Multiply 761 by 20 (tens place of 526, represented as 2 × 10):**.\n   ```.\n     761.\n   ×  20.\n   -------.\n   15220.\n   ```.\n   .\n3. **Multiply 761 by 500 (hundreds place of 526, represented as 5 × 100):**.\n   ```.\n     761.\n   × 500.\n   -------.\n  380500.\n   ```.\n   .\n4. **Add all the partial products:**.\n   ```.\n     4566.\n   + 15220.\n   +380500.\n   ---------.\n    400286.\n   ```.\n   .\n**Final Answer:**. Therefore, the answer is"]] 50%|#####     | 251/500 [1:30:20<1:59:04, 28.69s/it]
