.\n     \\( 936 \\times 1 = 936 \\).\n   - Multiply 936 by 20 (tens place of 121):  .\n     \\( 936 \\times 20 = 18,\\!720 \\).\n   - Multiply 936 by 100 (hundreds place of 121):  .\n     \\( 936 \\times 100 = 93,\\!600 \\).\n\n2. **Sum the results:**  .\n   \\( 936 + 18,\\!720 + 93,\\!600 = 113,\\!256 \\).\n\n**Verification with alternative methods:**  .\n- **Distributive Property:**  .\n  \\( 936 \\times (100 + 20 + 1) = 93,\\!600 + 18,\\!720 + 936 = 113,\\!256 \\)  .\n- **Component Splitting:**  .\n  \\( (900 + 36) \\times 121 = 108,\\!900 + 4,\\!356 = 113,\\!256 \\).\n\nAll methods confirm the final result.  .\n\n**Answer:**. Therefore, the answer is"]] 99%|#########8| 494/500 [2:04:17<00:38,  6.40s/it]
