2}\\right)^2\\):.\n     \\[.\n     \\left(\\frac{686 + 924}{2}\\right)^2 - \\left(\\frac{686 - 924}{2}\\right)^2 = 805^2 - 119^2.\n     \\].\n   - Calculate each square:.\n     \\[.\n     805^2 = 648025, \\quad 119^2 = 14161.\n     \\].\n   - Subtract the results:.\n     \\[.\n     648025 - 14161 = 633864.\n     \\]. Therefore, the answer is"]]100%|#########9| 498/500 [2:09:32<02:13, 66.91s/it]
